                                                "sense_id": "8420fb0d-2d69-3e54-afc1-89afab7bad3b",
                                                "text": "Ronald Frankau (pronounced Franco) wrote a few risky songs, such as FANNY'S BEEN EVACUATED NOW with the line “and for half a pound of butter, well a lady's got to eat” ~ he got banned for it."
